@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
title UC02/04/06/08 查询 序列图
actor 操作员 as U
boundary "列表与筛选/轨迹/HTTP API" as B
control "ApiController" as C
database "H2" as DB
U -> B : 校验路径参数
B -> C : 调用用例操作
C -> DB : SqlStore参数化SELECT；轨迹按时间和ID排序
DB --> C : 结果
C --> B : 返回真实数据库列表
B --> U : 显示结果或错误
@enduml
